Help me find the associations.  

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Food Coordinator",
      "description": "Organizes donations, deliveries, and communication between all participants."
    },
    {
      "name": "Donation Offer",
      "description": "Represents a donor’s available food items ready for collection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery",
      "description": "Represents a completed or scheduled transport of donated food.",
      "attributes": [
        "Route",
        "Food Donation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Route",
      "description": "Defines the planned path for a delivery or pickup."
    },
    {
      "name": "Food Donation",
      "description": "Represents a collection of food items contributed by a donor.",
      "attributes": [
        "Food Item"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Food Item",
      "description": "An individual edible product available for donation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Weekly Report",
      "description": "Summarizes weekly collection and delivery activity across the network."
    },
    {
      "name": "Food Recovery Data",
      "description": "Aggregated information about donated, collected, and distributed food."
    },
    {
      "name": "Recovery Driver",
      "description": "Collects donations and delivers them to partner organizations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Pickup Assignment",
      "description": "A task assigned to a driver specifying where and when to collect food."
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery Confirmation",
      "description": "Proof that a delivery has been successfully completed."
    },
    {
      "name": "Issue Report",
      "description": "Describes any delivery or pickup problems reported by drivers."
    },
    {
      "name": "Recovery Network",
      "description": "The collaborative system connecting donors, partners, and volunteers.",
      "attributes": [
        "Donor",
        "Distribution Partner"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Donor",
      "description": "A restaurant, store, or business contributing surplus food.",
      "attributes": [
        "Available Food Items",
        "Pickup Times"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Available Food Items",
      "description": "List of food items ready for donation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Pickup Times",
      "description": "Time windows when a donor’s food is available for collection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Distribution Partner",
      "description": "An organization receiving and distributing donated food to communities.",
      "attributes": [
        "Daily Capacity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Daily Capacity",
      "description": "The maximum amount of food a partner can store or distribute each day."
    },
    {
      "name": "Monthly Report",
      "description": "A donor’s summary of total contributions and impact per month."
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery Log",
      "description": "A record of completed deliveries including quantities and recipients."
    },
    {
      "name": "Shortage Report",
      "description": "A partner’s report of unmet food needs or low supply."
    },
    {
      "name": "Community Volunteer",
      "description": "Supports operations, events, and community outreach for the recovery network.",
      "attributes": [
        "Completed Hours"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Completed Hours",
      "description": "Tracks the total hours a volunteer has contributed."
    },
    {
      "name": "Local Event",
      "description": "Community activity promoting food recovery awareness."
    },
    {
      "name": "Government Food Inspector",
      "description": "Reviews data and compliance related to food safety and distribution."
    },
    {
      "name": "Evaluation Notice",
      "description": "A formal request or feedback document sent to assess network performance."
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name each object and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

